\section{Data, meshes and readers}{

\code{dk}, \code{aseg}, \code{tracula} and \code{suit} are the bundled atlases; ggseg and
ggseg3d re-export the same objects, so attaching any combination of them
masks nothing. \code{get_brain_mesh()} and \code{get_cerebellar_mesh()} return the
template surfaces. \code{read_atlas_files()}, \code{read_freesurfer_stats()} and
\code{read_freesurfer_table()} read data to plot on an atlas.
}

